00:08:47.900 --> 00:08:50.300
and also your dancing abilities.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.695
But in the different rounds you know,

00:08:51.695 --> 00:08:53.512
people get eliminated of course,

00:08:53.512 --> 00:08:55.130
but we get to save a few.

00:08:55.130 --> 00:08:57.600
So it's actually kind of
like the best part of our job

00:08:57.600 --> 00:08:59.550
on "The Voice" is that moment
when we get to save somebody

00:08:59.550 --> 00:09:01.040
and keep them in the competition.

00:09:01.040 --> 00:09:02.810
That's our journey
throughout the whole show.

00:09:02.810 --> 00:09:05.220
So I was actually, I was
thrilled to be there.

00:09:05.220 --> 00:09:06.330
Shakira is amazing.

00:09:06.330 --> 00:09:08.060
Lizza Koshi and,

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:09.060
- Love all of y'all.

00:09:09.060 --> 00:09:10.300
- Great, it's a great panel.

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:12.100
And we had a great time.

00:09:12.100 --> 00:09:14.600
- I love, on a serious note.

00:09:14.600 --> 00:09:17.320
I do feel like dancing is so therapeutic.

00:09:17.320 --> 00:09:20.300
Like I can be having the worst day ever,

00:09:20.300 --> 00:09:22.190
and I put my kids to bed,

00:09:22.190 --> 00:09:23.900
and then I literally put on music,

00:09:23.900 --> 00:09:25.190
and I dance alone in my house.

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:26.940
But it feels so good 'cause it just,

00:09:26.940 --> 00:09:29.930
it feels good to move your
body like that, anyway.

00:09:29.930 --> 00:09:30.920
'Cause I don't like working out,

00:09:30.920 --> 00:09:33.478
so I just choose to like dance.

00:09:33.478 --> 00:09:34.460
- I'm with you.

00:09:34.460 --> 00:09:35.960
- But on that note,

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:37.370
it's time for another break.

00:09:37.370 --> 00:09:39.430
Nick's show is called
"Dancing With Myself".

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:41.550
It premieres May 31st on NBC.

00:09:41.550 --> 00:09:42.800
Y'all gotta check it out.

